note: >
  Vendored so jaack.me and other sites can share these exact files.
  Do not edit jaack.css or jaack.js by hand; change the sources and run build.sh.
  theme.js stays separate and must load as a blocking script in <head>.
  The moxie hub (Vercel root directory moxie/) keeps a copy at
  moxie/jaack-design-system with the same zip sha. vendor/ is gitignored.
  Demo content is placeholder only. screenshots/ and demo.html are kept
  in git and excluded from the Jekyll site output.
  The packaged gold accent is Forma's shared default, not a site identity.
  jaack.me overrides accent and paper in assets/css/jaack-site.css.
  Narrow screens: the top bar and theme switch shrink (min-width: 0, flex-shrink)
  and switch buttons are 44px below 760px / 36px below 420px.
  jaack.me keeps its 44px touch targets. Same shared patch in the moxie copy.
